ion Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.25.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Dynamite Stick</b> has a <b>weak explosion</b>, and a <b>small radius</b>. Like any other explosive, it damages trees and ores, and can be used to open the gate at the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\">Skull Rock</a> to get the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a>.\n</p><p>Unlike bombs, dynamite blows up almost instantly in a chain reaction.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>● This price was originally priced at <b>$2,150</b>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903153828\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 66/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019482/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.451      1 Template:Explosive\n100.00%   28.451      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1018-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903153828 and revision id 12527. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Explosives","Interactive_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Skull","exists":true},{"title":"Skull Rock","exists":true}],"images":["Dynamite_Stic